{"suttaId":"thi-ap23","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[8766,8874],"vripara":"95"},"segments":{"thi-ap23:0.3":"Dhammadinnātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap23:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;","thi-ap23:1.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji nāyako.","thi-ap23:2.1":"“Tadāhaṃ haṃsavatiyaṃ, kule aññatare ahuṃ;","thi-ap23:2.3":"Parakammakārī āsiṃ, nipakā sīlasaṃvutā.","thi-ap23:3.1":"“Padumuttarabuddhassa, sujāto aggasāvako;","thi-ap23:3.3":"Vihārā abhinikkhamma, piṇḍapātāya [pattamādāya (ka.)] gacchati.","thi-ap23:4.1":"“Ghaṭaṃ gahetvā gacchantī, tadā udakahārikā;","thi-ap23:4.3":"Taṃ disvā adadaṃ pūpaṃ, pasannā sehi pāṇibhi.","thi-ap23:5.1":"“Paṭiggahetvā tattheva, nisinno paribhuñji so;","thi-ap23:5.3":"Tato netvāna taṃ gehaṃ, adāsiṃ tassa bhojanaṃ.","thi-ap23:6.1":"“Tato me ayyako tuṭṭho, akarī suṇisaṃ sakaṃ;","thi-ap23:6.3":"Sassuyā saha gantvāna, sambuddhaṃ abhivādayiṃ.","thi-ap23:7.1":"“Tadā so dhammakathikaṃ, bhikkhuniṃ parikittayaṃ;","thi-ap23:7.3":"Ṭhapesi etadaggamhi, taṃ sutvā muditā ahaṃ.","thi-ap23:8.1":"“Nimantayitvā sugataṃ, sasaṅghaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","thi-ap23:8.3":"Mahādānaṃ daditvāna, taṃ ṭhānamabhipatthayiṃ.","thi-ap23:9.1":"“Tato maṃ sugato āha, ghananinnādasussaro [ghananinnādasussare (ka.)];","thi-ap23:9.3":"‘Mamupaṭṭhānanirate, sasaṅghaparivesike.","thi-ap23:10.1":"“‘Saddhammassavane yutte, guṇavaddhitamānase;","thi-ap23:10.3":"Bhadde bhavassu muditā, lacchase paṇidhīphalaṃ.","thi-ap23:11.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","thi-ap23:11.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","thi-ap23:12.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādā, orasā dhammanimmitā;","thi-ap23:12.3":"Dhammadinnāti nāmena, hessati satthu sāvikā’.","thi-ap23:13.1":"“Taṃ sutvā muditā hutvā, yāvajīvaṃ mahāmuniṃ;","thi-ap23:13.3":"Mettacittā paricariṃ, paccayehi vināyakaṃ.","thi-ap23:14.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap23:14.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap23:15.1":"“Imamhi bhaddake kappe, brahmabandhu mahāyaso;","thi-ap23:15.3":"Kassapo nāma gottena, uppajji vadataṃ varo.","thi-ap23:16.1":"“Upaṭṭhāko mahesissa, tadā āsi narissaro;","thi-ap23:16.3":"Kāsirājā kikī nāma, bārāṇasipuruttame.","thi-ap23:17.1":"“Chaṭṭhā tassāsahaṃ dhītā, sudhammā iti vissutā;","thi-ap23:17.3":"Dhammaṃ sutvā jinaggassa, pabbajjaṃ samarocayiṃ.","thi-ap23:18.1":"“Anujāni na no tāto, agāreva tadā mayaṃ;","thi-ap23:18.3":"Vīsavassasahassāni, vicarimha atanditā.","thi-ap23:19.1":"Tatiyaṃ bhāṇavāraṃ.","thi-ap23:20.1":"“Komāribrahmacariyaṃ, rājakaññā sukhedhitā;","thi-ap23:20.3":"Buddhopaṭṭhānaniratā, muditā satta dhītaro.","thi-ap23:21.1":"“Samaṇī samaṇaguttā ca, bhikkhunī bhikkhudāyikā;","thi-ap23:21.3":"Dhammā ceva sudhammā ca, sattamī saṅghadāyikā.","thi-ap23:22.1":"“Khemā uppalavaṇṇā ca, paṭācārā ca kuṇḍalā;","thi-ap23:22.3":"Gotamī ca ahañceva, visākhā hoti sattamī.","thi-ap23:23.1":"“Tehi kammehi sukatehi, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap23:23.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap23:24.1":"“Pacchime ca bhave dāni, giribbajapuruttame;","thi-ap23:24.3":"Jātā seṭṭhikule phīte, sabbakāmasamiddhine.","thi-ap23:25.1":"“Yadā rūpaguṇūpetā, paṭhame yobbane ṭhitā;","thi-ap23:25.3":"Tadā parakulaṃ gantvā, vasiṃ sukhasamappitā.","thi-ap23:26.1":"“Upetvā lokasaraṇaṃ, suṇitvā dhammadesanaṃ;","thi-ap23:26.3":"Anāgāmiphalaṃ patto, sāmiko me subuddhimā.","thi-ap23:27.1":"“Tadāhaṃ anujānetvā, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap23:27.3":"Na cireneva kālena, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","thi-ap23:28.1":"“Tadā upāsako so maṃ, upagantvā apucchatha;","thi-ap23:28.3":"Gambhīre nipuṇe pañhe, te sabbe byākariṃ ahaṃ.","thi-ap23:29.1":"“Jino tasmiṃ guṇe tuṭṭho, etadagge ṭhapesi maṃ;","thi-ap23:29.3":"‘Bhikkhuniṃ dhammakathikaṃ, nāññaṃ passāmi edisiṃ.","thi-ap23:30.1":"‘Dhammadinnā yathā dhīrā, evaṃ dhāretha bhikkhavo’;","thi-ap23:30.3":"“Evāhaṃ paṇḍitā homi [jātā (sī.), nāma (syā.)], nāyakenānukampitā.","thi-ap23:31.1":"“Pariciṇṇo mayā satthā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ;","thi-ap23:31.3":"Ohito garuko bhāro, bhavanetti samūhatā.","thi-ap23:32.1":"“Yassatthāya pabbajitā, agārasmānagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap23:32.3":"So me attho anuppatto, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayo.","thi-ap23:33.1":"“Iddhīsu ca vasī homi, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap23:33.3":"Paracittāni jānāmi, satthusāsanakārikā.","thi-ap23:34.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap23:34.3":"Khepetvā āsave sabbe, visuddhāsiṃ sunimmalā.","thi-ap23:35.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap23:36.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap23:37.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap23:38.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ dhammadinnā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap23:39.1":"Dhammadinnātheriyāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
